// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  v1.99.14 - THE SIX ANIMS THAT WERE MISSED, AND WHY THE PACK-A-PUNCHED GUN
//  RENDERED AS A GIANT MISPLACED MODEL.
//
//  Five of these are the LEFT-HAND half of the dual-wield pair. With no
//  idleAnimLeft loaded the left gun has no animation to play, so it draws at
//  its bind pose - at the view origin, which reads as an enormous object
//  filling the screen. That is exactly what the user reported and screenshotted.
//
//  🛑 THE MISTAKE THAT CAUSED IT: the first pass enumerated anims by matching
//  the FIELD NAME suffix (*Anim, *_in, *_loop, *_out). The left-hand fields are
//  idleAnimLeft / fireAnimLeft / lastShotAnimLeft / reloadAnimLeft /
//  reloadEmptyAnimLeft / emptyIdleAnimLeft - they end in "Left" - and
//  meleeAnimEmpty ends in "Empty". All six fell outside the pattern.
//
//  🌟 THE CORRECT METHOD, used now and applied to every weapon this mod ships:
//  enumerate by VALUE, not by field name. Every value that starts with
//  "viewmodel_" is an xanim, full stop. See .agentsaudit_weapon_assets.js.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
xanim,viewmodel_fnp45_dw_left_fire
xanim,viewmodel_fnp45_dw_left_idle
xanim,viewmodel_fnp45_dw_left_idle_empty
xanim,viewmodel_fnp45_dw_left_lastshot
xanim,viewmodel_fnp45_dw_left_reload_empty
xanim,viewmodel_fnp45_tactical_melee_empty
